    "group": "Baharroth",
    "summary": "While leading a unit, this model gives it two options. As your opponent's turn ends, if the unit is outside Engagement Range of all enemy units, you may lift it off the battlefield and add it to your Strategic Reserves. And when the unit arrives via Deep Strike during your Movement phase, it may instead be set up anywhere more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy model, but it then cannot declare a charge this turn.",
